---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
import FAQPageSchema from '../components/FAQPageSchema.astro';
import LocalBusinessSchema from '../components/LocalBusinessSchema.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';

const city = "Garwood";
const latitude = 40.6269;
const longitude = -74.3224;

const faqs = [
  { q: "How far is AllStar from Garwood?", a: "About 5 minutes via local roads. 1166 West Chestnut St, Union. Free parking on-site." },
  { q: "What programs are available?", a: "Adult BJJ, Muay Thai, and MMA (ages 16+). Kids Lions (7–13) and Cubs (4–6). Summer camp runs seasonally." },
  { q: "Do I need experience?", a: "No. Most students — adults and kids — start with none." },
  { q: "Can I watch a class before enrolling my child?", a: "Yes. Walk in any time. We don't hide what we do." },
  { q: "What's the free trial?", a: "Two weeks of unlimited classes. Adults can try any program. Kids can try their age group. No card required, no contract, no pressure." },
  { q: "How do I start?", a: "Fill out the form on this page or call (908) 341-1131. We'll text to confirm a class time." },
];
---

<PageLayout
  title="Martial Arts in Garwood, NJ — BJJ, Muay Thai & Kids Classes | AllStar"
  description="Martial arts classes for Garwood, NJ families at AllStar Martial Arts in Union. BJJ, Muay Thai, MMA, and Kids programs. Renzo Gracie black belt. Free 2-week trial."
  ogImage="/images/adult-bjj-hero.jpg"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <LocalBusinessSchema city={city} latitude={latitude} longitude={longitude} />
    <FAQPageSchema faqs={faqs} />
  </Fragment>

  <PageHero
    eyebrow="5 minutes from Garwood"
    headline="Martial Arts in Garwood, NJ"
    sub="Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu, Muay Thai, MMA, and Kids programs — barely 5 minutes from Garwood, just over the Union line. Free 2-week trial, no contract."
    bgImage="/images/adult-bjj-hero.jpg"
  />

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Garwood packs a whole town into two-thirds of a square mile, so nothing is far — least of all us. AllStar is about 5 minutes from Grand Street on local roads, sitting at 1166 West Chestnut in Union right past the Garwood border. For the smallest borough in Union County, having a Renzo Gracie black belt this close is a genuine luxury — and one you can walk into with free parking out front. Neighbors in <a href="/westfield/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">Westfield</a> and <a href="/cranford/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">Cranford</a> drive further to get here.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
        Proximity gets people in the door once; the coaching keeps them. Coach Jamal Patterson is a Renzo Gracie black belt, ADCC veteran, and former professional MMA fighter who fought in the IFL and Bellator. That competition background changes how technique is taught — and students who've trained here five and ten years will tell you it shows up on the mat.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BJJ -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-brand-gray-light">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow">Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl text-brand-black mb-5">BJJ Classes Near Garwood, NJ</h2>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu is our flagship program. Adults 16 and up, beginners more than welcome — most people walk in with zero experience.
      </p>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Plenty of schools in the area teach BJJ, and some even share our lineage. The difference is the coach. Jamal's competition resume — ADCC, IFL, Bellator, UWC champion — isn't a credential gathering dust on a wall; it lives in how he explains every position. Here's the full <a href="/adult-bjj/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">adult BJJ</a> program.
      </p>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
        Evening classes at 6, 7, and 8 PM most weekdays — built around NJ Transit schedules and working adults who commute. With a 5-minute drive, Garwood folks can walk in the door minutes after leaving home. Two weeks free. No contract.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Kids -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow">Kids Martial Arts</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl text-brand-black mb-5">Kids Martial Arts Near Garwood, NJ</h2>
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <div class="bg-brand-gray-light p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-brand-gold">
          <h3 class="text-xl text-brand-black mb-2">Cubs — Ages 4–6</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-gray text-sm leading-relaxed">Preschool-age energy with martial arts structure around it. Coordination, listening, and confidence lead the way, taught in short, high-engagement stretches with constant positive reinforcement.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-brand-gray-light p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-brand-navy">
          <h3 class="text-xl text-brand-black mb-2">Lions — Ages 7–13</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-gray text-sm leading-relaxed">Real Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu technique — takedowns, escapes, positions. No katas, no filler; these Garwood kids learn a system that works, and parents keep telling us the confidence carries straight into school.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mt-5">
        Bully prevention is a real part of what we teach. When a kid knows they can handle themselves, the whole dynamic with a bully shifts — usually without a single punch. See how the <a href="/kids/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">kids program</a> works.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Muay Thai + MMA -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-brand-navy text-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-4xl">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow text-brand-gold">Muay Thai</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4">Muay Thai Near Garwood, NJ</h2>
          <p class="text-white/90 leading-relaxed">
            This is the one nobody else nearby pairs with BJJ. No gym in the Garwood, Union, or Kenilworth area offers authentic Muay Thai instruction under the same roof. Real pad work, real technique, real conditioning — and beginners are genuinely welcome.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow text-brand-gold">MMA</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4">MMA Classes Near Garwood, NJ</h2>
          <p class="text-white/90 leading-relaxed">
            Our MMA program puts BJJ, Muay Thai, and wrestling together into one complete system. Coached by Jamal Patterson — a pro MMA fighter who has cornered UFC athletes from their amateur debut to the pros. Adults 16 and up.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Landmarks -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow">If you know Garwood</div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-brand-black mb-5">You Know These Spots — We're 5 Minutes Away</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {["Downtown Garwood", "Grand Street", "Walnut Street", "Garwood Train Station", "Garwood High School", "North Avenue", "Union border", "Garwood Municipal Building"].map((l) => (
          <span class="bg-brand-gray-light text-brand-gray px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm">📍 {l}</span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FAQ items={faqs} />

  <CTA
    headline="Two Weeks Free — Garwood Families Welcome"
    sub="Show up. Bring water. We'll handle the rest. No commitment, no pressure."
  />
</PageLayout>
